                                "sense_id": "1aec7882-a027-3138-9148-622bb30d61d3",
                                "text": "Well, you should see Polythene Pam, / She's so good looking but she looks like a man. / Well, you should see her in drag, / Dressed in her polythene bag. / Yes, you should see Polythene Pam."
                            },
                            {
